#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "A pass only counts if it was really that chart, played straight. <0/>, <1/> and anything that changes the OD (<2/>, <3/>) disqualify it, and so does slowing the chart down; Mirror, the visibility mods and <4/>/<5/> are fine. The charts are matched by their notes and OD rather than by beatmap id, so any upload of the same file counts, while edits and rate versions do not."
#~ msgstr "A pass only counts if it was really that chart, played straight. <0/>, <1/> and anything that changes the OD (<2/>, <3/>) disqualify it, and so does slowing the chart down; Mirror, the visibility mods and <4/>/<5/> are fine. The charts are matched by their notes and OD rather than by beatmap id, so any upload of the same file counts, while edits and rate versions do not."

