#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Lazer shows slightly lower accuracy than stable for the same hits, so lazer plays are converted to stable accuracy here. A lazer 95.5% can count as a 96% clear because a stable player with the same hits would have 96%. This is not a bonus, and the Classic mod does not change it."
#~ msgstr "Lazer shows slightly lower accuracy than stable for the same hits, so lazer plays are converted to stable accuracy here. A lazer 95.5% can count as a 96% clear because a stable player with the same hits would have 96%. This is not a bonus, and the Classic mod does not change it."

