#~ msgstr "The engine gives back a continuous number, and the number is what everything else uses. The label you see is just that number printed in the ladder's own language. 4K regular runs 1st to 10th and then into the greek levels (alpha, beta, gamma and up). 4K LN runs 1 to 17, numbered up to 10 and named above it: Yoake, Yuugure, Yoru, Yami, Yume, Yokaze, Yeehee. 7K runs 0 to 10th and then Gamma, Azimuth, Zenith, Stellium. 6K stops at 9th, and its LN ladder carries on through Terra, Celestial, Mystery, Nihility and Finish."

