#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "To prevent abuse, the server counts requests per IP address for rate limiting and caps concurrent live connections per IP. These counters live in memory only: the backend does not write IP addresses to its database or logs. The server's request logs keep a shortened IP address with the last part removed and no user agent, for up to 90 days. Cloudflare, which sits in front of the site, keeps its own request logs. The server also records operational details such as job activity, upstream osu! API calls, and errors to monitor service health."
msgstr "To prevent abuse, the server counts requests per IP address for rate limiting and caps concurrent live connections per IP. These counters live in memory only: the backend does not write IP addresses to its database or logs. The server's request logs keep a shortened IP address with the last part removed and no user agent, for up to 90 days. Cloudflare, which sits in front of the site, keeps its own request logs. The server also records operational details such as job activity, upstream osu! API calls, and errors to monitor service health."

