msgid "When signed in, you can stop tracking or delete your profile from <0>My Stats</0>. Stopping tracking records nothing new and keeps what was already recorded. Deleting your profile hides it right away and deletes your plays, stats and profile history 7 days later, unless you cancel before then. Your packs, skins, uploaded replays and collections stay. Deleting everything also deletes those, along with your goals, Discord link and supporter status. Cards of you that other players pulled stay with them."
